{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wSv1Nq48kq1795643273.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方在屯門醫院拘捕一名男子，涉嫌跟麻醉針失竊案有關，有消息指疑犯是外科醫生，今早會在屯門裁判法院提堂。</p><p></p><p>警方周二接獲報案，懷疑有人在屯門醫院偷走一支麻醉針。警員同日下午於該院一個辦公室，檢獲共7支麻醉針，當場拘捕一名38歲男子，他被控一項盜竊罪及一項管有危險藥物罪。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:01:00.701720+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T19:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:35:25.815778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:54:22.208548+00:00","content_hash":"bc6c039bab5fef67bff6d601612e3c2a5b25f233005589fab6ecb379b9ed993a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:01:00.701720+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}